{"id":"desastre","lemma":"desastre","pos":"noun","rank":1034,"glosses":["disaster, catastrophe, calamity","disaster, a debacle, a bust","mess, shambles, wreckage"],"ipa":"/deˈsastɾe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"desastres"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/43/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-desastre.wav","examples":[{"text":"Aquello era un desastre.","en":"It was a disaster.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/690911"},{"text":"Los desastres naturales pueden ser devastadores.","en":"Natural disasters can be devastating."},{"text":"Sé que es un desastre.","en":"I know it's a mess.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448613"},{"text":"Los terremotos y las inundaciones son desastres naturales.","en":"Earthquakes and floods are natural disasters."},{"text":"Fue un total desastre.","en":"It was a total disaster."}]}